# User CRUD & Runtime Variable Chaining

A full Create → Update → Delete flow against [reqres.in](https://reqres.in), a public fake REST API built for exactly this kind of testing. **Create User** captures the new `id` with a `runtime-variables` block; **Update User** and **Delete User** both consume it as `{{process.user_id}}` — proving chaining actually works across sections, not just within one. **Get User** is a standalone section against a known static user, unrelated to the chain.

